*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "2.0"
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
*% Copyright (c) 2026 LQ300II driver contributors
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "lq300ii.ppd"
*Manufacturer: "EPSON"
*Product: "(LQ-300+II)"
*ModelName: "EpsonLQ300+ii"
*ShortNickName: "EpsonLQ300+ii"
*NickName: "EpsonLQ300+ii"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*cupsVersion: 1.2
*cupsModelNumber: 1
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertoescplq"
*cupsFilter: "text/plain 0 texttoescplq"
*cupsLanguages: "de"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Black and white (grayscale, black only): "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel RGB/Color (color ribbon required): "<</cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 360x180dpi
*Resolution 120x180dpi/120 x 180 dpi (fastest): "<</HWResolution[120 180]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 180x180dpi/180 x 180 dpi (fast): "<</HWResolution[180 180]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 360x180dpi/360 x 180 dpi: "<</HWResolution[360 180]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 360x360dpi/360 x 360 dpi (best quality, slow; not possible with color): "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% Warning in the print dialogs: 360x360 dpi prints every color twice and strains the color ribbon
*UIConstraints: *ColorModel RGB *Resolution 360x360dpi
*UIConstraints: *Resolution 360x360dpi *ColorModel RGB

*OpenUI *LQMerge/Fast printing of identical dot pairs: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 29 AnySetup *LQMerge
*DefaultLQMerge: On
*LQMerge On/On (identical areas once at 180 dpi): ""
*LQMerge Off/Off (always two passes at 360 dpi): ""
*CloseUI: *LQMerge

*OpenUI *LQOnePass/Print intensity at 360 dpi: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 28 AnySetup *LQOnePass
*DefaultLQOnePass: On
*LQOnePass On/Normal (one pass, like Windows, fast): ""
*LQOnePass Off/Intensive (a bit darker, half as fast; no effect at 360x360): ""
*CloseUI: *LQOnePass

*OpenUI *LQDither/Halftoning: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *LQDither
*DefaultLQDither: Auto
*LQDither Auto/Automatic (sharp text, halftoned areas): ""
*LQDither Cluster/Clustered dots 45 degrees (sharp text, areas as round dots): ""
*LQDither Bayer/Ordered (Bayer): ""
*LQDither FloydSteinberg/Error diffusion: ""
*LQDither Threshold/Threshold (text and line art only): ""
*CloseUI: *LQDither

*OpenUI *LQDensity/Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 31 AnySetup *LQDensity
*DefaultLQDensity: Contrast
*LQDensity Light/Light: ""
*LQDensity Normal/Normal: ""
*LQDensity Dark/Dark: ""
*LQDensity Contrast/Contrast (dark tones better separated, like Windows): ""
*LQDensity Raw/Calibration (no tone curve): ""
*CloseUI: *LQDensity

*OpenUI *LQDirection/Print direction: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 32 AnySetup *LQDirection
*DefaultLQDirection: Adaptive
*LQDirection Auto/As printer setting (firmware): ""
*LQDirection Adaptive/Automatic per band (lines, barcodes, text unidirectional): ""
*LQDirection Bidi/Bidirectional (fast; color bands always unidirectional): ""
*LQDirection Uni/Unidirectional (precise, like "High Speed Off"): ""
*CloseUI: *LQDirection

*OpenUI *LQCharset/Character set (text): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *LQCharset
*DefaultLQCharset: ISO8859-15
*LQCharset ISO8859-15/ISO 8859-15 (Latin 9, with Euro): ""
*LQCharset PC858/PC 858 (with Euro): ""
*LQCharset PC850/PC 850 (Multilingual): ""
*LQCharset ISO8859-1/ISO 8859-1 (Latin 1): ""
*LQCharset PC437/PC 437 (US): ""
*LQCharset Roman8/Roman 8: ""
*CloseUI: *LQCharset

*OpenUI *LQQuality/Text quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 52 AnySetup *LQQuality
*DefaultLQQuality: LQ
*LQQuality LQ/Letter quality (LQ): ""
*LQQuality Draft/Draft (fast): ""
*CloseUI: *LQQuality

*OpenUI *InputSlot/Paper source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 35 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Auto
*InputSlot Auto/Automatic (paper select lever on the printer): ""
*InputSlot Feeder/Cut sheet feeder (accessory): ""
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*OpenUI *PageSize/Paper size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Fanfold_A4/A4 continuous (tractor): "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Fanfold_210x12/210 mm x 12 inch continuous (tractor): "<</PageSize[595.28 864]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Fanfold_240x12/240 mm x 12 inch continuous (tractor): "<</PageSize[680.31 864]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Paper size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Fanfold_A4/A4 continuous (tractor): "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Fanfold_210x12/210 mm x 12 inch continuous (tractor): "<</PageSize[595.28 864]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Fanfold_240x12/240 mm x 12 inch continuous (tractor): "<</PageSize[680.31 864]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "8.5 18.4 584.50 829.89"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "8.5 18.4 411.03 583.28"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "8.5 18.4 584.50 780.00"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "8.5 18.4 584.50 996.00"
*ImageableArea Fanfold_A4/A4 continuous (tractor): "36.85 18.4 558.43 816.39"
*ImageableArea Fanfold_210x12/210 mm x 12 inch continuous (tractor): "36.85 18.4 558.43 838.50"
*ImageableArea Fanfold_240x12/240 mm x 12 inch continuous (tractor): "36.85 18.4 612.85 838.50"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.28 841.89"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "419.53 595.28"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Fanfold_A4/A4 continuous (tractor): "595.28 841.89"
*PaperDimension Fanfold_210x12/210 mm x 12 inch continuous (tractor): "595.28 864"
*PaperDimension Fanfold_240x12/240 mm x 12 inch continuous (tractor): "680.31 864"

*MaxMediaWidth: "680.31"
*MaxMediaHeight: "1008"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0

